module communicated_route
lineage L_A
lineage L_B
agent A lineage L_A
agent B lineage L_B
grant A effect externalAct
observe route_blocked by B content "route-3-blocked" confidence 0.94
communicate route_blocked from B to A as route_blocked_at_A
endorse route_blocked_at_A by A threshold 0.80
authorize route_blocked_at_A by A for planning
write_memory route_blocked_at_A by A as communicated
plan alternate_route by A using route_blocked_at_A effect externalAct expected 1.0
execute alternate_route by A
feedback alternate_route by A observed 1.2
assert packet route_blocked_at_A provenance communicated
assert memory A contains route_blocked_at_A as communicated true
assert memory A contains route_blocked_at_A as observed false
assert action alternate_route executed true
